WEBVTT

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:03.887
VIKI Agent brings Claude Code, your project knowledge,

00:00:04.229 --> 00:00:07.246
and a team of Bots into one local workspace.

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:10.317
Turn context into reviewed work.

00:00:12.524 --> 00:00:13.770
Start with the Vault.

00:00:14.766 --> 00:00:20.938
Your goals, tasks, sources, and decisions stay in Markdown you own.

00:00:21.853 --> 00:00:24.990
Bring the knowledge that matters into each conversation.

00:00:28.669 --> 00:00:32.672
Decision considers project signals, timing, and your feedback.

00:00:33.355 --> 00:00:34.358
It can stay quiet,

00:00:34.597 --> 00:00:35.934
suggest a next step,

00:00:36.127 --> 00:00:39.475
or start eligible work within the grants and limits you set.

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:45.288
Meet your Bots.

00:00:45.648 --> 00:00:48.383
Chief routes requests. Ops runs standups.

00:00:48.494 --> 00:00:50.821
Research finds sources. Writer drafts.

00:00:51.023 --> 00:00:52.952
Engineer plans code changes.

00:00:53.051 --> 00:00:54.668
Desk handles one-off jobs.

00:00:54.941 --> 00:00:56.327
Checker reviews the evidence.

00:00:58.344 --> 00:00:59.814
Give Chief the outcome.

00:01:00.223 --> 00:01:04.748
Kanban shows each task's status, Bot owner, and Done-when checklist.

00:01:08.719 --> 00:01:12.124
Open the specialists' work, then inspect Checker's review.

00:01:14.315 --> 00:01:16.157
Review permission requests.

00:01:16.839 --> 00:01:18.267
Follow the conversation.

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:21.527
Inspect the file and the changes.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.641
Read the result and its checks.

00:01:25.248 --> 00:01:28.820
VIKI Agent. Proactive coding.

00:01:28.961 --> 00:01:31.470
Decisions you control.
